   "text": "Customers without power across the storm counties: 1,604,454, rising. For water, PS-17 and PS-23 are below the pressure floor with no backup power, and PS-38 and PS-52 run on generators. The Cedarfall boil-water notice is in force; the Laurelspur notice is waiting for signatures. Hook up the portable generator at PS-17 (DC-D3-PS17-POWER) was decided on time. Set the restoration order of FDR-AIK-2219 and FDR-AIK-2207 (DC-D3-AIK-RESTORE-ORDER) needs Command and Water operations to sign, due Sep 27, 09:05 ET. Dispatch the fuel truck to PS-17 (DC-D3-PS17-FUEL) was missed.",
